---
import BaseLayout from '../../../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout 
  lang="en" 
  title="[Special Call] 1st North American AI Chinese Music Creation Contest: Phase 2 (Winter Solstice Wildcard) Open! | NACUAA Washington State" 
  description="The Organizing Committee officially announces the Phase 2 (Winter Solstice Wildcard) Supplementary Prelims Call! Deadline: Dec 19, 2026 (Sat) 23:59 EDT; Christmas results & IDs on Dec 25; unified Round 2 Semifinals on Jan 16, 2027. All 47 qualified Round 1 teams remain locked in; entrants may also submit additional new works within the 10-song quota." 
  path="/en/posts/2026-10-20-first-north-american-ai-chinese-music-contest-phase-2-opening/"
>
  <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-6 py-12 md:py-20">
    <a href="/en/posts/" class="inline-flex items-center gap-x-2 text-sm text-blue-500 hover:text-blue-400 mb-8 transition-colors">
      <i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-left"></i>
      <span>Back to News & Events</span>
    </a>

    <article class="space-y-8">
      <header class="border-b border-slate-900 pb-8 space-y-4">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-x-3 text-xs text-slate-500 mb-2 flex-wrap gap-y-1">
          <time datetime="2026-10-20">Tuesday, October 20, 2026</time>
          <span>·</span>
          <span class="px-2.5 py-0.5 rounded-full bg-amber-500/10 text-amber-400 border border-amber-500/20 font-semibold">Major Announcement</span>
          <span>·</span>
          <span class="px-2.5 py-0.5 rounded-full bg-purple-500/10 text-purple-400 border border-purple-500/20 font-semibold">AI Music Contest</span>
        </div>
        <h1 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight text-white leading-tight">
          🎵 [Phase 2 Open] 1st North American AI Chinese Music Creation Contest: Winter Solstice Wildcard Call Now Open!
        </h1>
        <p class="text-base text-amber-400 font-medium">
          Composing Chinese Stories with AI · Welcoming Creators Across 8 North American Divisions & Worldwide
        </p>
        <p class="text-xs text-slate-400 flex items-center gap-x-2 flex-wrap">
          <span>Jointly Presented by: NACUAA Washington State · ZJUAA NC · NACUAA NorCal · VI AI for Good Foundation</span>
        </p>
      </header>

      <!-- Official Poster -->
      <div class="rounded-3xl overflow-hidden border border-slate-800 shadow-2xl">
        <img src="/images/ChineseMusic_AI_Official_Poster.jpg" alt="ChineseMusic.AI Official Poster" class="w-full h-auto object-cover" />
      </div>

      <!-- Highlight Banner Card -->
      <div class="p-6 md:p-8 bg-gradient-to-br from-amber-950/40 via-slate-900 to-indigo-950/40 border border-amber-500/40 rounded-3xl space-y-6 shadow-2xl">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
          <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-amber-500/20 border border-amber-500/40 flex items-center justify-center text-amber-400 text-lg shrink-0">
            <i class="fa-solid fa-fire animate-pulse"></i>
          </div>
          <div>
            <h2 class="text-lg md:text-xl font-bold text-white">🔥 Special Supplementary Call in Response to Widespread Creator Interest</h2>
            <p class="text-xs text-slate-400">Round 1 admitted 47 teams with 145 works locked in · Phase 2 closes on Winter Solstice Eve, results on Christmas</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Key Dates Grid -->
        <div class="space-y-3">
          <div class="font-bold text-amber-300 text-sm flex items-center gap-2">
            <i class="fa-solid fa-calendar-check text-amber-400"></i>
            <span>⏰ Key Progression Milestones:</span>
          </div>
          <div class="grid sm:grid-cols-2 gap-3 text-xs text-slate-200">
            <div class="p-3.5 rounded-xl bg-slate-950/70 border border-slate-800 space-y-1">
              <span class="text-amber-400 block font-bold">❄️ Phase 2 Prelims Deadline</span>
              <span class="text-white font-mono font-semibold">Dec 19, 2026 (Sat) 23:59 EDT</span>
              <span class="text-[11px] text-slate-400 block">Winter Solstice Eve deadline</span>
            </div>
            <div class="p-3.5 rounded-xl bg-slate-950/70 border border-slate-800 space-y-1">
              <span class="text-emerald-400 block font-bold">🎄 Phase 2 Results & IDs</span>
              <span class="text-white font-mono font-semibold">Dec 25, 2026 (Christmas)</span>
              <span class="text-[11px] text-slate-400 block">Sequential IDs and official certificates issued</span>
            </div>
            <div class="p-3.5 rounded-xl bg-slate-950/70 border border-slate-800 space-y-1 sm:col-span-2">
              <span class="text-indigo-300 block font-bold">🏆 Round 2 Unified Semifinals</span>
              <span class="text-white font-mono font-semibold">Jan 16, 2027 (Sat) 23:59 EDT</span>
              <span class="text-[11px] text-slate-400 block">Post-Laba Festival. Both batches compete together for Grand Finale spots!</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="pt-2 flex flex-wrap gap-3">
          <a href="https://chinesemusic.ai/en/register" target="_blank" class="px-5 py-2.5 rounded-xl bg-gradient-to-r from-emerald-600 to-teal-600 hover:from-emerald-500 hover:to-teal-500 text-white font-bold text-xs transition-all shadow-lg hover:scale-105 flex items-center gap-1.5">
            <i class="fa-solid fa-pen-to-square"></i>
            <span>Phase 2 Register Now →</span>
          </a>
          <a href="https://chinesemusic.ai/roster" target="_blank" class="px-5 py-2.5 rounded-xl bg-slate-950 hover:bg-slate-800 text-slate-200 border border-slate-700 font-semibold text-xs transition-all hover:scale-105 flex items-center gap-1.5">
            <i class="fa-solid fa-trophy text-amber-400"></i>
            <span>Official Roster & IDs</span>
          </a>
          <a href="https://chinesemusic.ai/en" target="_blank" class="px-5 py-2.5 rounded-xl bg-slate-950 hover:bg-slate-800 text-slate-200 border border-slate-700 font-semibold text-xs transition-all hover:scale-105 flex items-center gap-1.5">
            <i class="fa-solid fa-globe text-blue-400"></i>
            <span>Contest Official Website</span>
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="text-slate-300 space-y-6 leading-relaxed text-base">
        <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-white border-l-4 border-amber-500 pl-3">
          1. Context: High Community Engagement Inspires Wildcard Call
        </h3>
        <p>
          Following the announcement of Round 1 results (47 creator teams, 145 original songs admitted) and the enthusiastic reception of the VI AI Music Academy masterclasses, numerous musicians and university scholars have requested an additional window to submit entries.
        </p>
        <p>
          By unanimous decision of the Organizing Committee and Jury Panel, a special <strong>Phase 2 (Winter Solstice Wildcard) Preliminary Call</strong> is now officially opened to creators across North America and worldwide!
        </p>

        <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-white border-l-4 border-amber-500 pl-3">
          2. Essential Rules & Guarantees
        </h3>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-2 text-sm text-slate-300">
          <li><strong>Round 1 Qualifications Fully Protected</strong>: All 47 teams and 145 works in Round 1 maintain permanent qualification without re-entry, enjoying more time to polish works;</li>
          <li><strong>Additional Songs Allowed (Up to 10 Total)</strong>: Entrants who submitted fewer than 10 works in Round 1 may enter additional brand-new tracks via Phase 2;</li>
          <li><strong>Strict Originality Standards</strong>: Brand new original compositions only; Chinese cultural essence; strictly categorized across 3 creation modes;</li>
          <li><strong>Sequential IDs & Official Certificates</strong>: Phase 2 works will be designated sequential IDs (NAM-27+, SNO-12+, INT-11+) with high-res 300 DPI certificates and on-chain verification.</li>
        </ul>

        <div class="p-5 rounded-2xl bg-slate-950/80 border border-slate-800 text-xs text-slate-400 space-y-2">
          <div class="font-bold text-slate-200 text-sm">💡 Inquiries & Direct Submissions</div>
          <p>Official Website: <a href="https://chinesemusic.ai" target="_blank" class="text-blue-400 hover:underline">https://chinesemusic.ai</a></p>
          <p>Submission Support: <a href="mailto:submit@chinesemusic.ai" class="text-blue-400 hover:underline">submit@chinesemusic.ai</a></p>
          <p>Academy Masterclasses: <a href="https://music.weiai.ai" target="_blank" class="text-purple-400 hover:underline">https://music.weiai.ai</a></p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </article>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
